id: SCA-017
title: Suspicious composer.json suspicious lifecycle scripts
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: composer.json
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: "(post-install-cmd|post-update-cmd|pre-install-cmd|post-autoload-dump)"\s*:.*\b(curl|wget|bash|php\s+-r)
    message: Composer lifecycle script executes network or shell command during install/update — supply chain attack vector.
fix: Audit all composer scripts. Remove any that make network calls or execute arbitrary code.
